<title>POLAND: STALEXPORT SWINGS TO PLN 6.0 MLN LOSS IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>STALEXPORT SWINGS TO PLN 6.0 MLN LOSS IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 6.05 vs   0.45 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   8.48 vs   0.75 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.15 vs   2.07</p>
<p> Sales		  239.06 vs 127.06</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.46 vs  14.03</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	15.03 vs  24.60</p>
<p> Operating profit    40.23 vs  22.58</p>
<p> Sales		 1236.08 vs 745.48</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish steel trader is Stalexport SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
